    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15884" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĕpaphrŏdītus</span></b> ,
			i, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a freedman of the Emperor Nero</i>, <i><span class="en">Suet.
